WEBVTT

00:06.480 --> 00:09.480
CAREER INTEREST SURVEY

00:06.480 --> 00:09.480
Grade

00:06.480 --> 00:09.480
Class

00:06.480 --> 00:09.480
Full Name

00:06.480 --> 00:09.480
1st Choice

00:06.480 --> 00:09.480
2nd Choice

00:06.480 --> 00:09.480
3rd Choice

00:06.730 --> 00:08.600
I had always thought...

00:09.480 --> 00:13.490
that one day I would become someone special.

00:13.900 --> 00:14.860
One day,

00:14.860 --> 00:18.490
I would find something where it was clear I had talent.

00:19.490 --> 00:21.920
For a long time now,

00:21.920 --> 00:27.500
I had always imagined that I was a knight who had fought many battles to protect a princess.

00:28.080 --> 00:28.750
But...

00:29.960 --> 00:32.760
It seems I didn't make it.

00:33.210 --> 00:34.500
What should I do?

00:41.220 --> 00:44.770
I liked that place.

00:45.440 --> 00:50.650
The quiet, empty train station where nobody came was the best place for reading alone.

00:53.280 --> 00:54.280
However,

00:54.820 --> 00:56.720
someone got here before me today.

01:03.830 --> 01:06.870
N-No trains come to this station.

01:10.880 --> 01:12.960
Ah, sorry. It's nothing.

01:13.300 --> 01:15.090
B-Bye.

01:17.050 --> 01:17.830
Yeah.

01:20.050 --> 01:22.890
Today was the first time I met her.

01:23.560 --> 01:29.060
That was —

01:23.560 --> 01:29.060
an encounter that lasted

01:23.560 --> 01:29.060
less than forty-five seconds.

01:23.930 --> 01:25.270
That was...

01:25.270 --> 01:27.890
an encounter that lasted less than forty-five seconds.

03:04.570 --> 03:06.740
Argh, I don't get it.

03:08.830 --> 03:11.210
Maybe I should go and do some research.

03:12.620 --> 03:15.210
Merry Christmas

03:12.620 --> 03:15.210
12/24 Shindou Kei

03:12.620 --> 03:15.210
I'm desperate!!

03:12.620 --> 03:15.210
12/22 Tsutsumi Kyosuke

03:13.460 --> 03:15.210
What? It's just Kei.

03:15.210 --> 03:15.460
Received Mails

03:15.210 --> 03:15.460
Still haven't finished yet?

03:15.210 --> 03:15.460
12/20 Dai

03:15.460 --> 03:20.380
Newly Received Mails

03:15.460 --> 03:20.380
From Shindou Kei

03:15.460 --> 03:20.380
Merry Christmas

03:15.460 --> 03:20.380
Onii-chan

03:15.460 --> 03:20.380
Don't forget about the party!

03:16.040 --> 03:17.630
Merry Christmas.

03:17.630 --> 03:20.050
Onii-chan, don't forget about the party!

03:20.380 --> 03:22.590
I guess I have no choice.

03:22.590 --> 03:24.590
I guess I'll stop by there on my way.

03:44.410 --> 03:45.780
Okay, cut.

03:46.490 --> 03:49.030
Did you get a good shot, Kyosuke?

03:49.030 --> 03:51.540
I only take good shots.

03:51.540 --> 03:54.710
If it snowed, that would be the best.

03:54.960 --> 03:55.880
No, no.

03:55.880 --> 03:57.960
That would make it difficult when you edit later on.

03:57.960 --> 03:59.210
Oh well.

03:59.210 --> 04:01.010
The library has it anyway.

04:01.010 --> 04:02.670
Let's go eat.

04:02.670 --> 04:03.340
Yeah.

04:19.820 --> 04:21.150
What is it?

04:21.570 --> 04:25.110
Nah, I was thinking it would be nice to take a shot for the cushion too.

04:26.950 --> 04:29.240
There must've been a pretty girl.

04:30.660 --> 04:32.750
Again? Is it that again?

04:32.750 --> 04:35.250
Aw, that hurts. O-O-O-Ouch...

04:36.500 --> 04:37.750
I'm home.

04:37.750 --> 04:40.290
Ah, welcome back, Kei-senpai.

04:40.290 --> 04:42.170
Sorry, Mizuki.

04:42.170 --> 04:44.470
The bakery was crowded.

04:44.470 --> 04:46.630
Eh, where's Onii-chan?

04:46.630 --> 04:48.640
He's not here yet.

04:49.640 --> 04:52.680
Are you serious? I wonder if he's really coming.

04:52.680 --> 04:55.640
I told him I wouldn't let him off if he stood us up again.

04:55.640 --> 04:59.020
Hiro-senpai always seems to be busy,

04:59.020 --> 05:00.980
even though he's not in a club or cram school.

05:00.980 --> 05:02.900
I'm sure he has his reasons.

05:02.900 --> 05:04.990
Mizuki, help me set them up.

05:04.990 --> 05:05.990
Okay.

05:06.320 --> 05:08.660
But he's a weird person.

05:08.660 --> 05:11.410
The other day, when it looked like he was deep in thought,

05:11.410 --> 05:13.910
he suddenly started scratching his head like crazy.

05:13.910 --> 05:17.000
As if he were a manga artist facing a deadline.

05:18.750 --> 05:21.460
What's wrong, Kei-senpai?

05:21.460 --> 05:23.590
Ah, nothing.

05:23.590 --> 05:25.510
I'll send him another e-mail.

05:28.470 --> 05:29.470
Receiving Mail• • •

05:29.470 --> 05:32.560
From Chihiro

05:29.470 --> 05:32.560
Merry Christmas

05:29.470 --> 05:32.560
Onee-chan

05:29.470 --> 05:32.560
Reply

05:29.470 --> 05:32.560
Transfer

05:29.470 --> 05:32.560
Delete

05:29.970 --> 05:32.550
Merry Christmas, Onee-chan.

05:33.100 --> 05:34.560
Chihiro...

05:45.650 --> 05:47.900
I wonder if I'm late.

05:51.910 --> 05:54.740
Eh, so this is how it looks inside.

05:57.250 --> 05:58.870
It's a pity.

06:01.250 --> 06:03.630
Mass has already ended.

06:03.630 --> 06:06.840
Ah, nah, I'm not a believer.

06:06.840 --> 06:08.880
I'm just here to do some research.

06:08.880 --> 06:10.130
Who are you?

06:10.890 --> 06:13.970
There's someone I have to meet here.

06:14.510 --> 06:15.970
You're waiting for someone?

06:19.940 --> 06:21.980
Well, I'll be leaving then.

06:21.980 --> 06:23.980
Ah, just a moment.

06:23.980 --> 06:25.400
What is it?

06:25.860 --> 06:27.530
Merry Christmas.

06:29.570 --> 06:31.410
Merry Christmas.

06:33.910 --> 06:35.030
It's cold.

06:35.660 --> 06:37.660
Newly Received Mail

06:35.660 --> 06:37.660
Shindou Kei

06:35.660 --> 06:37.660
You're late! Where are you?

06:35.910 --> 06:37.660
You're late. Where are you now?

06:37.660 --> 06:41.080
Ack, Kei is mad.

06:42.040 --> 06:43.170
Thief!

06:44.170 --> 06:45.540
Wait!

06:46.210 --> 06:49.050
Hey, did you see a bike?

06:49.050 --> 06:50.090
I did.

06:50.090 --> 06:51.550
Do you know which way it went?

06:51.550 --> 06:52.430
That way.

06:53.180 --> 06:55.470
Thank you. I'm borrowing this.

07:00.930 --> 07:02.520
Wait!

07:02.520 --> 07:04.190
My... bicycle!

07:04.190 --> 07:05.690
You bicycle thief!

07:06.690 --> 07:07.730
Hello.

07:07.730 --> 07:09.360
It's not "hello".

07:09.360 --> 07:13.240
Onii-chan, don't tell me you forgot about the party?

07:13.240 --> 07:14.490
I didn't.

07:14.490 --> 07:15.950
I'm just standing you up.

07:15.950 --> 07:19.040
What's with that defiant attitude?

07:19.040 --> 07:22.120
I don't have a dress for the ball.

07:22.120 --> 07:23.960
Are you Snow White?

07:23.960 --> 07:26.170
Nah, right now I'm Cinderella.

07:26.170 --> 07:28.000
They're the same!

07:28.000 --> 07:29.670
I don't have time for that now.

07:31.220 --> 07:33.550
Could it be that you got an urgent job?

07:33.550 --> 07:36.350
Yeah, I'm busy right now. We'll talk next time.

07:36.350 --> 07:38.640
"We'll talk next time", you say... eh, wait!

07:43.640 --> 07:46.310
Onii-chan, you idiot! Go die!

07:46.520 --> 07:48.780
I-I'm going to die!

07:53.910 --> 07:55.780
My bicycle...

07:56.240 --> 07:59.540
Hey, are you alive?

08:03.290 --> 08:05.790
Is this 119?

08:08.710 --> 08:12.550
When the ambulance gets here, I have to go with her, huh?

08:13.260 --> 08:15.300
Give me a break.

08:24.640 --> 08:26.520
She's alive, right?

08:26.520 --> 08:29.020
She can't be dead...

08:32.400 --> 08:33.490
Eh?

08:34.450 --> 08:38.030
What was I doing?

08:38.030 --> 08:40.450
Why are you asking me?

08:40.790 --> 08:42.080
I remember!

08:43.080 --> 08:44.540
W-Wait a second!

08:44.540 --> 08:46.290
You have to lie there.

08:46.290 --> 08:47.880
I was robbed.

08:47.880 --> 08:50.500
My important bag was stolen!

08:50.500 --> 08:52.510
What are you going to do if you hit your head?

08:52.510 --> 08:54.720
Wait till the ambulance gets here.

08:54.720 --> 08:57.510
No, that bag was expensive,

08:57.510 --> 09:00.140
and both my wallet and cell phone were inside.

09:00.140 --> 09:02.220
I'll definitely catch him!

09:02.560 --> 09:04.230
Hey, wait!

09:09.610 --> 09:12.980
Being in the park at night calms you down.

09:12.980 --> 09:15.490
What about the purse-snatcher?

09:15.490 --> 09:18.280
Didn't you say you'd definitely catch him?

09:18.280 --> 09:20.240
I ran too much and got tired.

09:20.240 --> 09:22.290
You give up quickly.

09:22.290 --> 09:23.870
It's okay, it's okay.

09:24.160 --> 09:26.750
There's no money in my wallet anyway,

09:26.750 --> 09:30.080
and the only number on my cell phone is my grandma's place.

09:30.080 --> 09:32.880
Besides, I was thinking of buying a new bag.

09:35.590 --> 09:37.220
It doesn't matter anymore.

09:37.220 --> 09:39.890
That's totally different from what you said earlier.

09:40.890 --> 09:43.890
More importantly, are you all right?

09:43.890 --> 09:46.060
Does it hurt somewhere, or do you feel like throwing up?

09:48.480 --> 09:50.020
Nah, not at all.

09:50.310 --> 09:52.900
Maybe you just don't feel the symptoms yet.

09:52.900 --> 09:54.280
You did pass out after all.

09:54.280 --> 09:56.610
I didn't pass out.

09:56.610 --> 09:58.780
You lost consciousness just like that.

09:58.780 --> 10:01.660
No way, I don't remember it at all.

10:01.660 --> 10:05.040
There's no way you'd remember passing out.

10:05.040 --> 10:06.040
Ah, really?

10:12.250 --> 10:13.540
Thank you.

10:15.460 --> 10:16.550
For what?

10:17.090 --> 10:20.050
Thank you for worrying about me.

10:20.390 --> 10:22.800
Wh-What are you saying?

10:22.800 --> 10:24.560
You're nice.

10:24.560 --> 10:25.850
Shut up.

10:25.850 --> 10:28.770
Anyway, it's better for you if you went to the hospital.

10:28.770 --> 10:30.560
Yeah, I'll think about it.

10:31.980 --> 10:33.060
Ah.

10:33.900 --> 10:36.360
It's snow. Snow.

10:38.110 --> 10:39.860
Amazing.

10:41.070 --> 10:42.320
Snow.

10:46.830 --> 10:48.870
Don't you think it's nice?

10:48.870 --> 10:52.630
To have a white Christmas like this with someone.

10:52.630 --> 10:54.250
Wh-Who knows?

10:54.250 --> 10:56.300
Geez, how cold.

10:56.300 --> 10:59.470
Isn't it sad to be alone on a day like this?

10:59.470 --> 11:01.010
It doesn't matter.

11:01.010 --> 11:03.300
I can live just by myself.

11:03.300 --> 11:04.550
I don't like being alone.

11:04.550 --> 11:06.970
I don't like being alone.

11:09.560 --> 11:12.350
I haven't told you my name, have I?

11:12.350 --> 11:14.400
I'm Miyamura Miyako.

11:14.400 --> 11:16.900
I'm Hirono Hiro.

11:16.900 --> 11:19.740
Hirono Hiro... Hiro Hiro, eh?

11:19.740 --> 11:21.530
What a strange name.

11:21.530 --> 11:24.870
Aren't you the same? Miyamura Miyako, Miya Miya.

11:24.870 --> 11:26.780
Hah, you're right.

11:26.780 --> 11:30.160
You found something interesting. You're smart.

11:30.950 --> 11:33.210
Say, Hirono-kun.

11:33.210 --> 11:34.920
Wh-What?

11:34.920 --> 11:36.710
There's no one...

11:36.710 --> 11:38.710
at my home tonight.

11:41.880 --> 11:44.470
You were thinking of something perverted, weren't you?

11:44.470 --> 11:45.180
Idiot.

11:45.180 --> 11:46.850
What are you talking about?

11:47.890 --> 11:52.600
Anyway, my house key was in that bag.

11:53.060 --> 11:54.100
So?

11:54.100 --> 11:58.190
I can't get into my house even if I go back there.

11:58.190 --> 12:01.530
I have to stay out tonight.

12:01.530 --> 12:02.490
On that subject,

12:02.490 --> 12:06.910
isn't it dangerous for a girl to stay out by herself?

12:07.330 --> 12:10.290
Don't tell me... you want me to come along with you...

12:10.620 --> 12:13.540
Isn't there a saying, "One might as well be hanged for a sheep as a lamb"?

12:14.330 --> 12:15.290
Come, let's go.

12:15.290 --> 12:17.590
Hey, w-wait. I'm not coming with you.

12:16.170 --> 12:18.290
It seems that Christmas this year...

12:17.590 --> 12:19.500
I've still got things to do...

12:20.460 --> 12:22.670
isn't ending just yet.

12:37.730 --> 12:39.770
During homeroom after school,

12:37.730 --> 12:40.730
CAREER INTEREST SURVEY

12:37.730 --> 12:40.730
Grade

12:37.730 --> 12:40.730
Class

12:37.730 --> 12:40.730
Full Name

12:37.730 --> 12:40.730
1st Choice

12:37.730 --> 12:40.730
2nd Choice

12:37.730 --> 12:40.730
3rd Choice

12:39.770 --> 12:42.950
the printouts from the career interest survey were handed out to us.

12:43.240 --> 12:46.360
Unlike the dream of the future we had when we were children,

12:46.360 --> 12:49.320
we now have to define our future concretely.

12:50.370 --> 12:54.250
"I want to be a prince who fights to protect a princess from disasters."

12:54.790 --> 12:58.750
I'm far past the age that would allow me to write down a dream like that.

13:00.340 --> 13:03.590
It seems I didn't make it.

13:03.590 --> 13:04.920
What should I do?

13:06.760 --> 13:08.640
And... why are you asking me?

13:09.010 --> 13:11.060
I want to hear an adult's opinion.

13:11.060 --> 13:15.270
I thought you might be able to give me some good advice.

13:15.270 --> 13:19.520
Sorry to disappoint you, but I'm not a pastor, or a counselor.

13:19.520 --> 13:22.280
But since you're always here,

13:22.280 --> 13:25.150
it's natural for me to approach you for advice.

13:25.150 --> 13:28.530
I'm just waiting for someone here.

13:29.030 --> 13:30.780
You're waiting for someone?

13:31.080 --> 13:33.160
What do you like?

13:33.160 --> 13:35.750
Eh? What do I like...?

13:35.750 --> 13:37.370
Reading, I guess.

13:37.370 --> 13:39.040
I like fiction.

13:39.500 --> 13:41.250
You can go with that then.

13:41.250 --> 13:44.380
After you graduate from a liberal arts college,
you can work in something related to publishing.

13:44.380 --> 13:46.260
You can also write fiction yourself.

13:46.260 --> 13:50.970
But, isn't it too hasty to just turn something I like into my job?

13:50.970 --> 13:54.520
It's a thousand times better than doing something you hate.

13:54.520 --> 13:56.680
Don't worry. Consider it.

13:58.430 --> 14:00.400
No more advice.

14:00.730 --> 14:03.230
This is my "adult's opinion".

14:03.940 --> 14:05.980
Adult's... opinion.

14:06.610 --> 14:09.160
I feel like I understand it, but I don't really get it.

14:09.160 --> 14:12.490
Either way, I have to think it through myself.

14:14.790 --> 14:17.580
He made it sound so simple...

14:29.930 --> 14:30.840
Yo.

14:32.050 --> 14:33.050
Hello.

14:33.470 --> 14:35.640
Did I interrupt you?

14:35.640 --> 14:36.640
No.

14:38.230 --> 14:41.350
Erm, can I ask you something weird?

14:42.060 --> 14:44.400
Did we meet before?

14:44.400 --> 14:45.820
Y-Yeah.

14:45.820 --> 14:47.280
Really?

14:47.280 --> 14:50.200
I'm sorry. As I thought, we did meet before.

14:50.200 --> 14:53.160
Well, actually we just said "hi" to each other.

14:53.160 --> 14:54.950
I guess you're right.

14:58.960 --> 15:00.540
E-Erm...

15:00.920 --> 15:01.710
Yeah?

15:02.040 --> 15:04.170
Do you always come here?

15:04.170 --> 15:06.540
Nah. Just now and then.

15:06.880 --> 15:09.050
This is a nice, quiet place.

15:09.050 --> 15:10.510
Yeah.

15:10.510 --> 15:12.680
It's the most suitable place for reading.

15:12.680 --> 15:16.050
Besides, I can openly act out "Stand By Me" here.

15:12.680 --> 15:16.060
Renji is referring to the 1986 movie "Stand By Me", directed by Rob Reiner.

15:16.850 --> 15:19.390
I mean walking on the railroad track.

15:19.390 --> 15:21.230
No one will scold me if I do it here.

15:24.400 --> 15:26.110
Ah, I see.

15:26.110 --> 15:27.860
It sounds like fun.

15:29.400 --> 15:30.490
Chihiro

15:31.650 --> 15:32.860
I'm Chihiro.

15:32.860 --> 15:35.370
My name is Shindou Chihiro.

15:35.370 --> 15:38.160
Lions drop their cubs into an abysmal valley.

15:35.370 --> 15:40.580
Abysmal valley (senjin no tani), is how her name is written.

15:38.160 --> 15:40.580
It's written as Senjin and read as Chihiro.

15:40.870 --> 15:42.830
I'm Asou Renji.

15:43.170 --> 15:44.670
Asou-san, right?

15:44.670 --> 15:45.500
Yeah.

15:45.880 --> 15:47.920
Chihiro, you're early.

15:47.920 --> 15:48.840
Early?

15:48.840 --> 15:49.670
Yeah.

15:49.670 --> 15:53.420
You came earlier than me the other day as well.

15:53.420 --> 15:54.800
That's because...

15:54.800 --> 15:57.800
I'm not attending school.

15:58.510 --> 16:01.310
You're not... going to school?

16:01.600 --> 16:02.560
Yes.

16:02.850 --> 16:05.060
Ah, is that so?

16:05.060 --> 16:06.190
Yes.

16:08.440 --> 16:09.770
I'm sorry.

16:11.280 --> 16:13.780
I'm going home now.

16:13.780 --> 16:15.450
Eh, what's wrong?

16:15.450 --> 16:17.620
This is your place.

16:17.620 --> 16:21.450
I think I'm bothering you, and you seem to feel uneasy.

16:21.450 --> 16:23.290
That's not true.

16:23.290 --> 16:25.250
It's not like that at all.

16:25.250 --> 16:27.750
I'm thinking something similar too.

16:27.750 --> 16:31.460
Because I'm here, you can't take your time to read.

16:31.460 --> 16:33.800
That's not true at all.

16:33.800 --> 16:35.090
Please don't worry about it.

16:35.090 --> 16:37.840
Same for me. Don't worry about it.

16:45.400 --> 16:48.100
I'll walk you home. Do you live nearby?

16:48.100 --> 16:52.110
Nah, I want to stay here a bit longer.

16:52.110 --> 16:53.610
It's getting dark already.

16:53.990 --> 16:55.360
I want to stay here.

16:56.610 --> 16:57.490
I see.

16:58.610 --> 16:59.240
Erm...

17:00.740 --> 17:04.370
Can I still come here?

17:06.670 --> 17:07.620
Of course.

17:08.960 --> 17:10.170
Thank you.

17:12.050 --> 17:14.130
See you, then.

17:14.130 --> 17:15.090
...you.

17:16.630 --> 17:17.840
What's wrong?

17:17.840 --> 17:18.970
Nothing.

17:19.680 --> 17:21.850
See... you.

17:21.850 --> 17:23.520
See you.

17:39.620 --> 17:41.030
What were you looking at?

17:41.660 --> 17:44.160
I wasn't looking at anything.

17:44.160 --> 17:45.250
What about the sky?

17:45.250 --> 17:47.040
Ah, you're right.

17:47.500 --> 17:49.170
I was looking at the sky.

17:51.090 --> 17:52.170
Are you all right?

17:52.460 --> 17:54.960
What do you mean?

17:54.960 --> 17:58.130
Well, you look different from yesterday.

17:58.260 --> 17:59.430
Yesterday?

18:01.050 --> 18:04.140
Erm, could you be Asou-san?

18:04.140 --> 18:04.850
Eh?

18:04.850 --> 18:06.390
Yeah, that's me.

18:07.690 --> 18:08.430
What's wrong?

18:08.770 --> 18:11.730
Yesterday's "see you"...

18:12.190 --> 18:14.230
Yesterday's... what?

18:14.440 --> 18:16.400
"See you"...

18:22.740 --> 18:25.830
Ah, wh-what's wrong, Chihiro?

18:25.830 --> 18:27.910
Erm, it's not like that.

18:27.910 --> 18:30.080
It's not. It's not...

18:30.080 --> 18:32.750
Oh no. Why... did I...?

18:33.090 --> 18:35.210
Even though you ask me why...

18:35.210 --> 18:36.420
It's not...

18:36.420 --> 18:38.760
This is not what I meant to do...

18:39.880 --> 18:41.510
A-Are you all right?

18:42.050 --> 18:43.550
I'm okay.

18:43.550 --> 18:46.470
I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

18:49.440 --> 18:54.400
Erm, why did you come today, Asou-san?

18:54.400 --> 18:56.690
Eh, well, it's because...

18:57.320 --> 18:59.030
I-I don't really know why.

18:59.030 --> 19:00.660
I see.

19:01.160 --> 19:02.410
I'm sorry.

19:02.410 --> 19:05.540
I was too happy and misunderstood.

19:06.740 --> 19:08.040
I'm sorry.

19:08.040 --> 19:09.910
Please forget about it.

19:09.910 --> 19:14.040
Does that mean she was happy to see me?

19:14.040 --> 19:15.920
But we've only met three times,

19:15.920 --> 19:17.960
she couldn't be so happy that she'd hug me and cry...

19:18.380 --> 19:20.050
That's impossible.

19:20.420 --> 19:21.800
Asou-san.

19:23.050 --> 19:24.800
That pocket...

19:24.800 --> 19:27.930
Ah, it's the novel I'm currently reading.

19:27.930 --> 19:30.430
Do you like fiction?

19:30.430 --> 19:33.560
Yeah, it's like I'm a wordaholic.

19:33.560 --> 19:36.230
I always carry a few books in my pocket.

19:36.570 --> 19:39.820
If I don't, it feels unnatural, as if I'm not carrying enough weight.

19:39.820 --> 19:42.320
It's just like a cat's whiskers.

19:42.320 --> 19:45.320
Eh? Ah, I see.

19:45.320 --> 19:47.080
That's cute.

19:48.120 --> 19:50.830
That book of yours is like a cat's whiskers too?

19:50.830 --> 19:52.710
Something like that.

19:52.710 --> 19:54.960
I can't live without it.

19:55.420 --> 19:56.630
Same as me.

19:56.630 --> 19:57.840
Yeah.

20:00.420 --> 20:04.180
Asou-san, I have a favor to ask you. May I?

20:04.470 --> 20:05.430
What is it?

20:06.140 --> 20:07.470
Can you...

20:07.810 --> 20:10.180
be friends with me?

20:10.600 --> 20:11.930
Friends?

20:13.140 --> 20:14.690
You don't want to?

20:14.690 --> 20:16.770
N-Nah, of course I do!

20:16.770 --> 20:19.440
I'm the one who'd like to ask you to be my friend.

20:20.280 --> 20:21.240
Yes.

20:24.700 --> 20:25.820
See you.

20:27.080 --> 20:27.910
Yes.

20:28.740 --> 20:33.080
See you

20:33.790 --> 20:36.170
Yeah... Yahoo!

20:37.540 --> 20:40.550
Asou-san went home after saying that.

20:40.550 --> 20:41.800
I was happy.

20:42.260 --> 20:47.550
Asou-san made a promise to me yesterday, and he came to see me today.

20:47.890 --> 20:52.310
Today he also promised me that he would come see me tomorrow.

20:52.770 --> 20:56.730
And he became friends with me.

21:04.280 --> 21:08.200
Even though I shouldn't indulge myself in something like this.

21:09.910 --> 21:11.620
Kei-oneechan.

22:22.230 --> 22:29.740
itoshisa ya setsunasa omoiegaki

22:22.230 --> 22:29.740
Imagining love and pain

22:31.820 --> 22:38.160
kuchibiru yubisakide nazoru

22:31.820 --> 22:38.160
I trace my lips with my fingertip

22:41.460 --> 22:48.970
ima mo afuredasu kono omoi wa

22:41.460 --> 22:48.970
This feeling I have overflows even now

22:51.050 --> 22:59.520
towa ni kawaranai dakara

22:51.050 --> 22:59.520
Since it will never change

23:02.480 --> 23:11.910
kanashii yoru wa mou owari shinjiteru

23:02.480 --> 23:11.910
I believe the sad evening is already over

23:12.070 --> 23:24.380
atarashii asa zutto futari de

23:12.070 --> 23:24.380
The two of us will be together through the whole new morning

23:28.210 --> 23:31.630
The two of us meet again, and the uncertain time begins to move.

23:32.470 --> 23:35.640
Next episode, ef - a tale of memories:

23:36.010 --> 23:37.180
Upon a time.

23:37.910 --> 23:41.220
Do you have memories you don't want to forget?
